ggitnore file
📄 Complete .gitignore File — Detailed Version
Bhai ye comprehensive .gitignore hai — har tarah ke file cover karta hai. Isse copy karke apne project ke root me .gitignore naam se save kar de.

📁 Kahan Rakhna Hai?
text
C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-gpu-cluster-manager\.gitignore
Root folder me — README.md ke saath, backend/ aur frontend/ ke bahar.

📄 Complete .gitignore Content
Ye poora content hai — copy karke .gitignore file me paste kar:

gitignore
# ================================================================
# MULTI-AGENT GPU CLUSTER MANAGER — .gitignore
# ================================================================
# Ye file batati hai Git ko kaunsi files IGNORE karni hain
# (yani GitHub pe push NAHI karni)
# ================================================================


# ================================================================
# 1. PYTHON
# ================================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Python Virtual Environments
venv/
env/
ENV/
.venv/
pythonenv*/
.python-version

# PyInstaller
*.manifest
*.spec

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# Unit test / coverage reports
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.cache
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
cover/
pytestdebug.log

# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints

# IPython
profile_default/
ipython_config.py

# pyenv
.python-version

# Celery
celerybeat-schedule
celerybeat.pid

# SageMath
*.sage.py

# Environments
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.test

# Spyder
.spyderproject
.spyproject

# Rope
.ropeproject

# mkdocs
/site

# mypy
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json

# Pyre type checker
.pyre/

# pytype
.pytype/

# Cython
cython_debug/


# ================================================================
# 2. SECRETS & ENVIRONMENT (⚠️ VERY IMPORTANT)
# ================================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
secrets.json
credentials.json
config.local.json
*secret*
*credential*
api_keys.txt


# ================================================================
# 3. DATABASE FILES
# ================================================================
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
backend/data/*.db
backend/data/*.sqlite
backend/data/*.sqlite3
!backend/data/.gitkeep


# ================================================================
# 4. NODE / JAVASCRIPT / REACT
# ================================================================
node_modules/
node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.js
.pnp.cjs

