📝 Common Commit Messages (Ready to Use)
Koi bhi ek choose kar:

powershell
# Initial setup ke liye
git commit -m "Initial commit: Multi-Agent GPU Cluster Manager"

# README add karne ke liye
git commit -m "Add detailed README documentation"

# Backend code ke liye
git commit -m "Add backend agents and API implementation"

# Frontend code ke liye
git commit -m "Add React dashboard UI"

# Bug fix ke liye
git commit -m "Fix scheduler agent reasoning logic"

# Feature add karne ke liye
git commit -m "Add failure prediction with Gemini API"

# Generic update
git commit -m "Update project files"
⚠️ Common Issues & Fixes
Issue 1: nothing to commit, working tree clean
Matlab: Kuch naya change nahi hai commit karne ke liye.

Fix: Kuch file change karo pehle (README edit karo ya naya file banao), phir commit.

Issue 2: Authentication failed
Fix: PAT (Personal Access Token) use karo, GitHub password nahi.

PAT banao:

https://github.com/settings/tokens

"Generate new token (classic)"

Note: git push

Expiration: 90 days

Scope: ✅ repo

Generate → copy ghp_xxxxx...

Push pe password me paste karo

Issue 3: rejected - non-fast-forward
Fix: Pehle pull karo, phir push:

powershell
git pull origin main --rebase
git push
Issue 4: Please tell me who you are
Fix: Git config set karo:

powershell
git config --global user.name "Vishakha"
git config --global user.email "your-email@gmail.com"
⚠️ Apna real email daalo (jo GitHub pe registered hai).

