Multi-Agent GPU Cluster Manager Guide
🚀 Git Push — Complete Commands (PowerShell Me)
Bhai ye exact commands hain. PowerShell me ek-ek line chalao. Copy-paste ready hai.

⚡ Quick One-Shot (Agar Sab Ready Hai)
PowerShell me ye ek line paste karo:

powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-gpu-cluster-manager; git add .; git commit -m "Update project files"; git push
Enter dabao. Done! ✅

📋 Detailed Step-by-Step (Recommended)
PowerShell me ek-ek karke chalao:

1️⃣ Project folder me jao:
powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-gpu-cluster-manager
2️⃣ Kya changed hai dekho:
powershell
git status
Output dekh:

Red files = uncommitted changes

Green files = staged (already added)

3️⃣ Sab files add karo:
powershell
git add .
4️⃣ Verify staged files:
powershell
git status
Green me dikhni chahiye saari files.

5️⃣ Commit karo (message ke saath):
powershell
git commit -m "Update: Add README and project structure"
⚠️ "Update: Add README and project structure" ki jagah apna message likh sakta hai.

Example messages:

powershell
git commit -m "Add backend agents implementation"
git commit -m "Fix scheduler agent logic"
git commit -m "Update README documentation"
git commit -m "Add GPU simulator module"
6️⃣ Push karo:
powershell
git push
Output:

text
Enumerating objects: 5, done.
Counting objects: 100% (5/5), done.
Writing objects: 100% (3/3), 250 bytes | 250.00 KiB/s, done.
To https://github.com/vishakha2121/multi-agent-gpu-cluster-manager.git
   abc1234..def5678  main -> main
Bas! Push ho gaya! 🎉

🎯 Full Command Sequence (Copy-Paste Ready)
powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-gpu-cluster-manager
git status
git add .
git status
git commit -m "Update project with latest changes"
git push
Ye 6 lines PowerShell me paste karo (ek saath bhi chalega PowerShell me ; ya new line se).

📝 Common Commit Messages (Ready to Use)
Koi bhi ek choose kar:

powershell
# Initial setup ke liye
git commit -m "Initial commit: Multi-Agent GPU Cluster Manager"

# README add karne ke liye
git commit -m "Add detailed README documentation"

# Backend code ke liye
git commit -m "Add backend agents and API implementation"

# Frontend code ke liye
git commit -m "Add React dashboard UI"

# Bug fix ke liye
git commit -m "Fix scheduler agent reasoning logic"

# Feature add karne ke liye
git commit -m "Add failure prediction with Gemini API"

# Generic update
git commit -m "Update project files"
⚠️ Common Issues & Fixes
Issue 1: nothing to commit, working tree clean
Matlab: Kuch naya change nahi hai commit karne ke liye.

Fix: Kuch file change karo pehle (README edit karo ya naya file banao), phir commit.

Issue 2: Authentication failed
Fix: PAT (Personal Access Token) use karo, GitHub password nahi.

PAT banao:

https://github.com/settings/tokens

"Generate new token (classic)"

Note: git push

Expiration: 90 days

Scope: ✅ repo

Generate → copy ghp_xxxxx...

Push pe password me paste karo

Issue 3: rejected - non-fast-forward
Fix: Pehle pull karo, phir push:

powershell
git pull origin main --rebase
git push
Issue 4: Please tell me who you are
Fix: Git config set karo:

powershell
git config --global user.name "Vishakha"
git config --global user.email "your-email@gmail.com"
⚠️ Apna real email daalo (jo GitHub pe registered hai).

🎯 Complete Workflow (Har Baar Ke Liye)
Ye har baar karna jab bhi code change karo:

powershell
# 1. Project folder me jao
cd C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-gpu-cluster-manager

# 2. Kya change hua dekho
git status

# 3. Sab files add karo
git add .

# 4. Commit karo (message ke saath)
git commit -m "Your descriptive message here"

# 5. Push karo
git push
Bas 5 commands. Har baar. Simple!

📸 Ek Baar Ye Chala Ke Bhej
PowerShell me:

powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-gpu-cluster-manager
git status
git add .
git status
git commit -m "Update project"
git push
Pooora output copy-paste kar mujhe. Main dekh ke confirm karunga:

✅ Push hua?

❌ Koi error aaya?

🔥 Super Short Version
Agar bas jaldi hai, ye ek line chalao:

powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-gpu-cluster-manager; git add .; git commit -m "Update"; git push
Done! 💪

🎬 Bata Mujhe
Push hua successfully? → 🎉 Great!

Koi error aaya? → Error message bhej

Ab kya? → Backend code likhna shuru karun? Frontend?

Bata bhai — output bhej ya next step bata! 🚀

ggitnore file
📄 Complete .gitignore File — Detailed Version
Bhai ye comprehensive .gitignore hai — har tarah ke file cover karta hai. Isse copy karke apne project ke root me .gitignore naam se save kar de.

📁 Kahan Rakhna Hai?
text
C:\Users\HP\multi-agent-gpu-cluster-manager\.gitignore
Root folder me — README.md ke saath, backend/ aur frontend/ ke bahar.

📄 Complete .gitignore Content
Ye poora content hai — copy karke .gitignore file me paste kar:

gitignore
# ================================================================
# MULTI-AGENT GPU CLUSTER MANAGER — .gitignore
# ================================================================
# Ye file batati hai Git ko kaunsi files IGNORE karni hain
# (yani GitHub pe push NAHI karni)
# ================================================================


# ================================================================
# 1. PYTHON
# ================================================================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Python Virtual Environments
venv/
env/
ENV/
.venv/
pythonenv*/
.python-version

# PyInstaller
*.manifest
*.spec

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# Unit test / coverage reports
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.cache
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
cover/
pytestdebug.log

# Jupyter Notebook
.ipynb_checkpoints

# IPython
profile_default/
ipython_config.py

# pyenv
.python-version

# Celery
celerybeat-schedule
celerybeat.pid

# SageMath
*.sage.py

# Environments
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.test

# Spyder
.spyderproject
.spyproject

# Rope
.ropeproject

# mkdocs
/site

# mypy
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json

# Pyre type checker
.pyre/

# pytype
.pytype/

# Cython
cython_debug/


# ================================================================
# 2. SECRETS & ENVIRONMENT (⚠️ VERY IMPORTANT)
# ================================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
secrets.json
credentials.json
config.local.json
*secret*
*credential*
api_keys.txt


# ================================================================
# 3. DATABASE FILES
# ================================================================
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
backend/data/*.db
backend/data/*.sqlite
backend/data/*.sqlite3
!backend/data/.gitkeep


# ================================================================
# 4. NODE / JAVASCRIPT / REACT
# ================================================================
node_modules/
node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.js
.pnp.cjs

# Testing
/coverage
coverage/
*.lcov

# Production build
/build
/dist
dist/
dist-ssr/
out/
.next/
.nuxt/
.vuepress/dist/

# Vite
.vite/
.vite-cache/

# Miscellaneous
*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.npm
.yarn-integrity
.yarn/cache
.yarn/unplugged
.yarn/build-state.yml
.yarn/install-state.gz
.pnp.*


